export const PLATFORM_BG    = { '官網':'#D6E4F7','momo':'#FAECE7','蝦皮':'#FFE8D6','經銷':'#E1F5EE' };
export function getCurrentYM() {
  const d = new Date();
  return { year: d.getFullYear(), month: d.getMonth() + 1 };
}
